{
  "id": "poem-f23f0241331c405ab73463dc",
  "title": "江头送别",
  "author": "徐田臣《杀狗记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "杀一狗，杀一狗，生魂那里？思量起，思量起，泪珠暗垂。",
    "当初养你防家计，谁知道今日有灾危！(杀介。",
    "旦、贴上)。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-1885",
